      </p>

      <h2>1. Service Description</h2>
      <p>
        Dikduk is a free educational application designed to help users learn Biblical Hebrew grammar. The service includes:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Interactive lessons on Hebrew grammar</li>
        <li>Practice exercises with feedback</li>
        <li>Progress tracking (stored locally or synced with an optional account)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        All educational content is provided free of charge. Account creation is optional and only required for syncing progress across devices.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Account Responsibilities</h2>
      <p>
        If you choose to create an account:
