      <p>
        The content on Dikduk, including lessons, exercises, code, and design, is protected by copyright and other intellectual property laws.
      </p>
      <p>
        You may:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Use the service for personal, non-commercial learning</li>
        <li>Share links to Dikduk with others</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You may not:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Copy or redistribute our content</li>
        <li>Create derivative works based on our content</li>
        <li>Use our content for commercial purposes</li>
